ency of the reduction by 25%%.\n\t\tMolten points are removed upon running or resting.\n\t\t#{italic}#Hot liquid metal, the fun!#{normal}#\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的护甲温度极高，能驱散部分能量攻击。\n\t\t所有非物理、非精神伤害降低 %d 点（当前 %d）。\n\t\t每回合该效果触发时，你获得 1 点融化点数（最多 10 点），使减伤效率降低 25%%。\n\t\t奔跑或休息时会清除融化点数。\n\t\t#{italic}#火热的液态金属，乐趣无穷！#{normal}#\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c296536348673b506460e7eed66c9faea8872a4104bf61c806bbf2e35ec397cd","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"0dad236cbef331baedb65a4b99f477704eb0f15f626f94c79faa44ea9fca6db3","logical_entry_identity":"24a2ba727c3ebfff6364ad3fcb7fcd8d95ef667f02f30a318978906b3d067c4d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"chest (plundered)","source_tag":"_t","target":"被洗劫的箱子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec00128ccc234616b5f500a4dbb846439d9a895552451751bdc829d2136c6f8e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"0db48b9b11c709febe6f6842bcad62a669df6ee8dc0b7c564a998e16f61ebea3","logical_entry_identity":"3b8321154cab9d6121f187689de24b32e12fec80ff07d25d199f76f75c51b4c6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Collected 40 ritch eggs in the Ritch Hive.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在里奇巢穴中收集 40 枚里奇蛋。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"}}